Package: tiDML
Title: Double Machine Learning with parsnip, recipes, and workflows
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
        c(person(given = "Justin", family = "Beresford",
             email = "justin.beresford@frontier-economics.com",
             role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Implements Double Machine Learning (DML) with cross-fitting. Model-agnostic, it accepts nuisance learners via parsnip and recipes, or offers a concise API for a handful of default models. Methods follow recent literature on debiased machine learning, and results are shown to be verifiably correct. 
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/justinberesford/tiDML
